    "title": "Chester's Chicken Plans College Park Edgewater Drive Spot - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ashley Johnson ,\n14 hours ago A long-quiet CITGO station at 3460 Edgewater Drive may be trading gas pumps for drumsticks, with plans in the works to convert the site into a Chester's Chicken outpost that would plug the national fried-chicken brand into Orlando’s College Park neighborhood. The concept would lean on the old gas-station footprint for a compact, quick-serve kitchen and counter setup. Plans are still early, and no public opening date has been floated yet. Read full article",
